docs {
  Endpoint: GET {{baseUrl}}/api/counties?name={term}
  Search counties by name substring.

  Query: `name` string, required for useful filtering.

  Response 200: `{ "counties": [...] }`.
  Example: `GET /api/counties?name=Pest`.
}
